WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
The first film showed how a new genetic difference can begin.

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.220
How can one mutation help in one setting but not another?

3
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.560
Follow its effect.

4
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.960
Keep the DNA fixed while the world moves around it.

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.280
A mutation does not come with a fixed label.

6
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.080
Its effect depends on the change, and often on its environment.

7
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.480
Start with colour.

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.400
A label only makes sense beside a measured outcome.

9
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.670
Place the beetle on a matching background.

10
00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.530
It is harder to notice there.

11
00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.570
Slide the same beetle onto a contrasting background.

12
00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.430
It becomes easier to notice.

13
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.910
The model shows a possible effect, not a promised outcome.

14
00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:53.643
The DNA did not change during that move.

15
00:00:54.863 --> 00:00:56.083
The environment changed.

16
00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:01.043
A colour that affects survival one way here may act differently there.

17
00:01:02.263 --> 00:01:04.123
That separation is the key test.

18
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:06.953
Predict before the next move.

19
00:01:08.253 --> 00:01:12.753
If the background changes again, must the beetle's DNA change before the colour's

20
00:01:12.753 --> 00:01:15.873
effect changes? Hold your answer.

21
00:01:17.173 --> 00:01:19.053
Keep your eyes on the locked gold marker.

22
00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:29.947
No. Keep the mutation fixed and change only the setting.

23
00:01:31.287 --> 00:01:35.667
The effect can change because survival and reproduction happen in an environment,

24
00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:40.707
not outside one. The same change now meets different conditions.

25
00:01:41.867 --> 00:01:45.527
Many mutations change little that matters for survival.

26
00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:48.407
Some harm how a protein works.

27
00:01:49.707 --> 00:01:52.087
A few can help under particular conditions.

28
00:01:53.507 --> 00:01:55.447
These are outcomes, not intentions.

29
00:01:56.747 --> 00:02:00.207
A mutation can also change how much protein a cell makes.

30
00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.130
Bacteria make the same point.

31
00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.370
One mutation can allow growth with an antibiotic.

32
00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.150
Yet with different food, which mutant grows best can change.

33
00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.970
Food and the drug are both parts of the environment.

34
00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:19.033
Human examples differ too.

35
00:02:20.733 --> 00:02:23.813
Continued lactase production can help where adults drink milk.

36
00:02:25.093 --> 00:02:29.833
A dry-earwax change has no survival effect shown in this lesson's evidence.

37
00:02:31.153 --> 00:02:34.073
These cases test different traits under different conditions.

38
00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:37.833
Effect and inheritance are separate questions.

39
00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:44.633
In animals that reproduce with eggs and sperm, a helpful body-cell mutation still

40
00:02:44.633 --> 00:02:45.813
cannot reach offspring.

41
00:02:47.193 --> 00:02:50.293
A sex-cell mutation can pass without being helpful.

42
00:02:51.733 --> 00:02:54.333
Usefulness cannot open a blocked inheritance route.

43
00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:58.047
So do not judge a mutation from its name alone.

44
00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:03.287
Compare the changed trait, the environment, survival, and reproduction.

45
00:03:05.147 --> 00:03:07.067
Evidence decides the effect in that setting.

46
00:03:08.347 --> 00:03:11.307
Without those comparisons, the label is only a guess.

47
00:03:12.417 --> 00:03:14.737
The tables below give that evidence.

48
00:03:16.017 --> 00:03:20.817
Use them to separate what changed from the conditions in which scientists tested it.

49
00:03:21.797 --> 00:03:25.037
The text also gives limits that this picture cannot carry.
